{
  "id": "E054",
  "title": "A Short Haircut",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-10-01",
  "synopsis": "Girls cut their hair short for many different reasons.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/244/3c326e575bb2348c8f219b0b657390129ccb0b9b.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "剪短发\n\n女生A：你怎么剪短头发了？\n女生B：是啊，上星期刚剪的。\n女生A：你不会和男朋友分手了吧？\n女生B：没有啦！我不是因为分手才剪短头发，而是因为天气太热了。\n女生A：的确。这天气热得真让人受不了。\n女生B：而且现在因为工作需要，我想让自己看起来更成熟一些。短头发看起来更干练，你不觉得吗？\n女生A：是啊是啊，你看起来绝对老了五岁呢！\n女生B：真的假的？",
    "traditional": "剪短髮\n\n女生A：你怎麼剪短頭髮了？\n女生B：是啊，上星期剛剪的。\n女生A：你不會和男朋友分手了吧？\n女生B：沒有啦！我不是因為分手才剪短頭髮，而是因為天氣太熱了。\n女生A：的確。這天氣熱得真讓人受不了。\n女生B：而且現在因為工作需要，我想讓自己看起來更成熟一些。短頭髮看起來更幹練，你不覺得嗎？\n女生A：是啊是啊，你看起來絕對老了五歲呢！\n女生B：真的假的？"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "A Short Haircut"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "女生A：你怎么剪短头发了？",
      "traditional": "女生A：你怎麼剪短頭髮了？",
      "pinyin": "nǚ shēng nǐ zěn me jiǎn duǎn tóu fa le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Girl A: How come you cut your hair so short?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "女生B：是啊，上星期刚剪的。",
      "traditional": "女生B：是啊，上星期剛剪的。",
      "pinyin": "nǚ shēng shì a shàng xīng qī gāng jiǎn de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Girl B: Yeah, I just did it last week."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "女生A：你不会和男朋友分手了吧？",
      "traditional": "女生A：你不會和男朋友分手了吧？",
      "pinyin": "nǚ shēng nǐ bú huì hé nán péng you fēn shǒu le ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Girl A: Did you break up with your boyfriend?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "女生B：没有啦！我不是因为分手才剪短头发，而是因为天气太热了。",
      "traditional": "女生B：沒有啦！我不是因為分手才剪短頭髮，而是因為天氣太熱了。",
      "pinyin": "nǚ shēng méi yǒu la wǒ bú shì yīn wèi fēn shǒu cái jiǎn duǎn tóu fa ér shì yīn wèi tiān qì tài rè le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Girl B: Nah. I cut it not because of breakups, but because it is so hot."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "女生A：的确。这天气热得真让人受不了。",
      "traditional": "女生A：的確。這天氣熱得真讓人受不了。",
      "pinyin": "nǚ shēng dí què zhè tiān qì rè de zhēn ràng rén shòu bù liǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Girl A: Indeed. The heat is just unbearable."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "女生B：而且现在因为工作需要，我想让自己看起来更成熟一些。",
      "traditional": "女生B：而且現在因為工作需要，我想讓自己看起來更成熟一些。",
      "pinyin": "nǚ shēng ér qiě xiàn zài yīn wèi gōng zuò xū yào wǒ xiǎng ràng zì jǐ kàn qǐ lái gèng chéng shú yì xiē",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "短头发看起来更干练，你不觉得吗？",
      "traditional": "短頭髮看起來更幹練，你不覺得嗎？",
      "pinyin": "duǎn tóu fa kàn qǐ lái gèng gàn liàn nǐ bù jué de ma",
      "english": "Girl B: Also, due to the requirement of my job, I want to look more mature."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "People in short haircuts look more capable and experienced, don’t you think?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "女生A：是啊是啊，你看起来绝对老了五岁呢！",
      "traditional": "女生A：是啊是啊，你看起來絕對老了五歲呢！",
      "pinyin": "nǚ shēng shì a shì a nǐ kàn qǐ lái jué duì lǎo le wǔ suì ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Girl A: Yeah yeah. You definitely look five years older!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "女生B：真的假的？",
      "traditional": "女生B：真的假的？",
      "pinyin": "nǚ shēng zhēn de jiǎ de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Girl B: For real?"
    }
